  (text
    "Hub 1 runs from the always-on +5V_AON so a blank MCU enumerates (first flash over USB). One link to the VIM3: no USB cables. Port 1 MCU, 2 touch, 3 GNSS module USB, 4 second hub (external ports + RTL-SDR). Route D+/D- as 90 ohm pairs."
    (at 610 345 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "b345b540-23b9-59b0-a1da-90129aaed096"))
  (text
    "VIM3 header pins 3/4 are a working USB host port (confirmed by Glenn, 2026-09-29)."
    (at 610 349 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "23ec2b25-4b18-52d9-adfb-0e53d44bbcc3"))
